---
---
<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Visual background element -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-full h-full bg-indigo-600/5 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center relative z-10">
        <div>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-8 leading-none">The Engine behind <br/><span class="text-indigo-500">The Multiverse</span></h2>
            
            <div class="space-y-8">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="text-white font-bold flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full"></span>
                        Graph-Based Relational Data
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Our database isn't a flat list; it's a <strong>Mathematical Graph</strong>. Every Anime, Studio, and Voice Actor is a "Node," and every production role is an "Edge." This allows us to calculate the shortest possible path between any two points in the anime industry using a <strong>Breadth-First Search (BFS)</strong> algorithm.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="text-white font-bold flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full"></span>
                        Force-Directed Physics (D3)
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        To make the web interactive, we use the <strong>D3-Force</strong> engine. It treats nodes like physical particles with charge and gravity, ensuring that the nodes on your screen never overlap and behave like a living, breathing ecosystem.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="text-white font-bold flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full"></span>
                        High-Performance WebGL
                    </h4>
                    <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Driftaku is rendered via <strong>PixiJS</strong>, a lightning-fast WebGL library. This allows us to render thousands of lines and images at 60 frames per second, even on low-end mobile devices.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 p-2 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-2xl rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-transform duration-700">
            <div class="bg-slate-950 rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-white/5">
                <h3 class="text-white font-black uppercase mb-6 text-center tracking-widest text-xs opacity-50">Database Statistics</h3>
                <div class="space-y-6">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-end">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase">Total Relationships</span>
                        <span class="text-white font-mono text-xl font-bold">142,804</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-1.5 w-full bg-slate-900 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="h-full w-[85%] bg-indigo-500 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(99,102,241,0.5)]"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex justify-between items-end">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase">Unique Nodes</span>
                        <span class="text-white font-mono text-xl font-bold">52,119</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-1.5 w-full bg-slate-900 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="h-full w-[60%] bg-emerald-500 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(16,185,129,0.5)]"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex justify-between items-end">
                        <span class="text-slate-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase">Daily Graph Permutations</span>
                        <span class="text-white font-mono text-xl font-bold">∞</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-1.5 w-full bg-slate-900 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="h-full w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 via-cyan-500 to-emerald-500"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-8 text-[10px] text-slate-500 text-center uppercase font-bold tracking-widest">Powered by AniList GraphQL data</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>